// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3766711262" "I will be upfront with you, {HeroName}. I was recruited into the Luddites because of my experience with the occult, beyond the Circle of Thorns or the Banished Pantheon.<br><br>One group that I have been pursuing for years has been the Rulu-Shin. They worship an entity known as <color yellow>Rularuu</color>. He is, in the plainest terms, a devourer of dimensions. Currently, he is trapped within the <color yellow>Shadow Shard</color>. These Rulu-Shin worship him as a god, and want to see him return into this world.<br><br>It is ridiculous, of course; they know the moment he enters the world, he will attempt to destroy <i>everything</i>. They believe that they will become 'one' with him at that point and reach true happiness. It's insane, to be sure, but at the same time, this is what makes them extremely dangerous. They fervently believe that Rularuu will satisfy their endless desire for happiness, and they will stop at <i>nothing</i> to achieve that.<br><br> At any rate, I know of where we might be able to track them down."
// AcceptString :
"P2413957749" "Where?"
// SendOffString :
"P1942027288" "<color yellow>Sharkhead Isle</color>. I know the area quite well from my time there. Their members have been using the graveyard there as a gathering place.<br><br>At first, the Rulu-Shin were small, but now it seems they grow day by day. I believe the destruction of Galaxy City has caused people to look for answers to their lives in very strange places. Some may scoff at the idea, but I suppose others would see it as a relief; a being of infinite power that comes into the world and takes away all your problems, all your worries.<br><br>I can arrange a boat to get you to the cemetary. From there, it will be up to you to get to the bottom of this. I should warn you, the Rulu-Shin are very <i>disturbed</i>. Be on your guard."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1988244315" "Find the Rulu-Shin Meeting Grounds"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P720112392" "I wish I could help you, but I must stay here in Paragon."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1280136884" "<color deepskyblue>Part II: Believers</color>"

