// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P255753788" "What did you find down there? Hrm... Interesting. At least we've stopped one of their gatherings, but who knows how many more they have? It's disturbing that they had the aid of a <color yellow>Wisp</color>, but at least it was one that did not actively seek to kill you.<br><br><color orange>You explain to Michael that you found a cellphone off of the Rulu-Shin Gatherer, which gave details about a man named Harry Stein holding items for the Rulu-Shin.</color><br><br>Hrm, a man named Harry Stein is holding the supposed items for the Rulu-Shin? I just may be able to help you with this. However, we will have to hurry. If I'm correct, we may already be too late to save Numina's father.<br><br>I think I've figured out what the Rulu-Shin are up to. They mentioned how they were looking to use 'magic bodies' to 'feed' the change, yes? I believe they are literally <i>feeding</i> something to a creature. If that's the case, then we have no time to lose."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - GuardTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3364405018" "<color orange>The guard looks you up and down.</color><br><br>Mr. Stein is busy. What do you want?"
// Page Intro SayOutLoudText :
"P2712681916" "Mr. Stein is busy. What do you want?"
// Answer Text :
"P1459271771" "My name is {HeroName}. I need to speak with him about urgent business."
// Page Pass Text :
"P2581876555" "<color orange>The guard raises his eyebrow, recognizing your name. He slowly nods.</color><br><br>You can go through. But try anything and we'll be on you."
// Page Pass SayOutLoudText :
"P4102306444" "You can go through. But try anything and we'll be on you."
// Answer Text :
"P3936123470" "Alright."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Manager 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Ambushed Text :
"P1567564556" "Security! SECURITY!"
// Page DoorRevealed Text :
"P1663327094" "I've told you everything, what else do you want from me?"
// Answer Text :
"P1697732190" "I'm bringing you in, Stein."
// Page OKtoTalk Text :
"P1941730535" "Ah... my guards let you through. That was good of them.<br><br>My name is Harry Stein. What can I do for a fine super powered being such as yourself? Are you here to purchase some goods?"
// Page OKtoTalk SayOutLoudText :
"P1547103546" "My name is Harry Stein. What can I do for a fine super powered being such as yourself? Are you here to purchase some goods?"
// Answer Text :
"P1577500992" "My name is {HeroName}. I'm here to talk to you about some items from the Midnighters."
// Page NotOK Text :
"P3172990345" "GUARDS!"
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"
// Page Interrogate Text :
"P1525918030" "Items from the Midnighters? I'm afraid I have no idea what you're talking about.<br><br>All of the items that I receive have been taken from reliable sources, I do not deal in 'stealing' items."
// Page Interrogate SayOutLoudText :
"P4108341806" "All of the items that I receive have been taken from reliable sources, I do not deal in 'stealing' items."
// Answer Text :
"P895141294" "(Force the issue by threatening Harry)"
// Answer Text :
"P3651486427" "(Try to convince Harry to tell you the truth)"
// Page BadCop Text :
"P3901000722" "<color orange>You use your own somewhat violent methods to convince Harry Stein to talk. He snaps and begins to blather.</color><br><br>F-fine! Don't hurt me! I didn't think this whole Rulu-Shin cult was a good idea after all!<br><br>Look, they've already tossed almost all the artifacts they found into some monster. The head of the local group, he's in the warehouse now, said he was going to keep the skull with him, even though it was worthless.<br><br>I don't know what he meant, but here's the key to our warehouses. Just go there and leave me alone!"
// Page BadCop SayOutLoudText :
"P837341079" "<t=5 d=5>F-fine! Don't hurt me! I didn't think this whole Rulu-Shin cult was a good idea after all! <t=5 d=5> The head of the local group, he's in the warehouse now, said he was going to keep the skull with him, even though it was worthless.<br><br>The monster is already long gone, they said that their work was going to go far into bringing Rularuu into the world!"
// Answer Text :
"P647319202" "That's all I needed. I'm off."
// Answer Text :
"P1820976762" "Not so fast. You're under arrest for dealing with the Rulu-Shin!"
// Page BringIn Text :
"P250780226" "Under arrest? I don't think so, we're in the Rogue Isles, YOUR law isn't enforced here. GUARDS!"
// Answer Text :
"P479110482" "Fine...!"
// Page GoodCop Text :
"P4273639449" "<color orange>Harry Stein shakes his head.</color><br><br>I'm telling you, I have nothing but legitimate items in my store. I'm actually <i>quite</i> insulted that you would assume otherwise.<br><br>If there's nothing else, please leave, I have other business that I must attend to."
// Page GoodCop SayOutLoudText :
"P3063486994" "I'm telling you, I have nothing but legitimate items in my store. I'm actually quite insulted that you would assume otherwise. If there's nothing else, please leave, I have other business that I must attend to."
// Answer Text :
"P2367811074" "(Leave to find another way)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Cabinet 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2116429158" "<color orange>There are three file cabinets. Which one do you look through?</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P193943964" "(Top Cabinet)"
// Answer Text :
"P3696714571" "(Middle Cabinet)"
// Answer Text :
"P1873770880" "(Bottom Cabinet)"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P4161013081" "<color orange>You find documents regarding sales of artifacts to a  group called the Rogue Arachnos within Warburg. The document has details saying that the group seems to be planning some sort of large operation soon.</color>"
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P4039270390" "<color orange>You find some keys in the cabinet, with the label, 'Storage warehouse' on them. It's possible that this is the area where the Rulu-Shin are gathering inside the warehouse!</color>"
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P3615509815" "<color orange>You sift through the bottom cabinet and find files regarding some recent artifacts that were purchased.<br><br>The files go into detail about how the artifacts dated back to Cimeroran times, and how they believed they were linked to the fate of a great leader of Cimerora.</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1536313281" "The Rulu-Shin are intent on doing anything they can to bring back Rularuu into this world. As you've no doubt seen, they have managed to bring in weakened... 'representatives' of the creature.<br><br>I believe that these creatures can become more powerful if they feed on magical items or beings. In all likelihood, they saw the Midnighter Squad as a giant <i>refridgerator</i> for Rularuu.<br><br>You need to get to Harry Stein's store before they try to feed Numina's father to this Rularuu monster!"
// AcceptString :
"P372458833" "Where is the store?"
// SendOffString :
"P2570444593" "The store is in Sharkhead Isle. You'll have to be on your guard. This Harry Stein who runs it is part of the Rulu-Shin, but this is his 'old life' as they call it. <br><br>He won't try to reveal himself in the open, but his store will be <i>well</i> protected by security. <color yellow>You'll want to be careful about where you go. The place will be wired to send in a security team if you do anything suspicious.</color><br><br>When you've found the location of the Rulu-Shin and Tommy Arcanus, you'll be in for a fight. <color orange>You'll want to prepare yourself for anything when you go in there.</color><br><br>I wish I could help you, {HeroName}, but my presence there will only hinder you. I am a known enemy of the Rulu-Shin, and should I go in there, the security guards will attack me on sight."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2085107107" "Save Tommy Arcanus"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P826285493" "You need to hurry, or else Tommy Arcanus will be eaten by some sort of creature!"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3697257497" "<color deepskyblue>Finale: My Dear Father</color>"

