// 5 Caption :
"P3663186523" "<x=0.5 y=0.2 t=6 d=5><scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor DimGray>Meanwhile, in the back of a bar in the Rogue Isles..."
// 6 Actor1 :
"P1995552797" "<t=6 d=6>The skull of Tommy Arcanus has been recovered by {HeroName}. However, the Rulu-Shin relayed the information they found to me.."
// 6 Actor1 :
"P263598324" "<t=6 d=6>Numina's possession is not a simple spell; she inherited it from her father's bloodline."
// 6 Actor2 :
"P51312671" "<t=6 d=6>Hrm... unfortunate. We could destroy her, but the obelisk will not absorb the powers of a spectre."
// 5 Actor1 :
"P3236171145" "<t=5 d=5> Does this mean that the list is shortened? That the one I was meant for shall be our next target?"
// 5 Actor2 :
"P3209243908" "<t=5 d=5> Calm yourself. This is no simple plan. There are... steps that must be taken. But yes, we are moving towards that."
// 5 Actor2 :
"P4141865761" "<t=5 d=5>We must make our next move, one that will put Manticore and Statesman in our way. You know what to do."
// 6 Actor1 :
"P2611341285" "<t=6 d=6> ...Excellent. I will inform Blitz that the time has come to play his role. It will be a grand stage that we will set."
// 5 Actor2 :
